  "limitations": [
    "Legal out-and-back setup placements create synthetic long histories, not a complete competitive match",
    "Identical current two-player pitch and forced successful pass/catch dice; 22-player match roster remains",
    "Real SetupApplication action/checkpoint/reply with in-memory repository; SQL, transport and browser excluded",
    "Cold load and recovery verification are outside measured action handling",
    "Compaction cohorts set the resident journal cursor to its 31-entry boundary immediately before the action; payload and current pitch are unchanged",
    "Reported medians/p95/max use equal-count duration samples from three independent JVMs; absolute clocks are never aligned",
    "Twelve samples per cohort are too few for stable long-term tail estimates; per-run medians are retained",
    "Initial recovery verification uses a separate 2 GiB process to avoid duplicating live state in the measurement JVM",
    "This isolates history-length sensitivity, not elapsed turn number or live end-to-end latency"
  ]
}